The vectorized activation kernel in kernel.cu.in is adapted from SGLang:

  https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang
  Revision: 095ec6c997bfdd25d3864cb0ce77a6562a934b96
  python/sglang/kernels/jit/csrc/elementwise/activation.cuh
  python/sglang/kernels/jit/include/sgl_kernel/vec.cuh

Upstream distributes these files under Apache-2.0. Neither source file has an
