The unmodified upstream Apache license is included as LICENSE in this directory.

The adapted implementation retains act_and_mul_kernel's vector work division,
vector loads/stores, unrolled activation loop, and kRoundActivation branch.
OrbitKV changes the input ABI to separate gate/up buffers, preserves its graph's
explicit F32 exp2/reciprocal operations instead of replacing them with expf SiLU,
uses 64-bit vector indexing, and adds a scalar fallback for unaligned externally
bound pointers. Expert filtering, PDL, reuse-input, TVM FFI, and other activations
are omitted. Vector width is 16 bytes, valid on Hopper and earlier CUDA targets.
